# The inquiry form's primary transport needs no secrets: it is the Cloudflare
# `SEND_EMAIL` binding in wrangler.jsonc, sending inquiry@kestrra.com ->
# INQUIRY_TO (a verified Email Routing destination). Free, and no third party
# holds the mail.
#
# The variables below are the OPTIONAL second transport, tried only if the
# binding is missing or throws. Leave them unset in production. With both
# unset, the form shows the direct-contact fallback rather than pretending to
# have sent.
RESEND_API_KEY=
INQUIRY_TO=
INQUIRY_FROM="Kestrra <inquiry@kestrra.com>"
